{
  "title": "P3 · Pitter Patter（V10）",
  "order": 1,
  "assetBase": "/media/3d-music/",
  "htmlClass": "pp-deck",
  "slides": [
    {
      "id": "g3d-title",
      "title": "Pitter Patter",
      "notes": "先複習《採桑曲》，再學雨聲詩歌與旋律，最後教直笛。總時數70分鐘。",
      "html": "<section id=\"g3d-title\" class=\"pp-slide cover\" data-slide-id=\"g3d-title\" aria-label=\"Pitter Patter\"><img class=\"background-art\" src=\"./assets/images/garden-rain.png\" alt=\"雨點落在繽紛花園中\" loading=\"eager\"><div class=\"pp-copy\"><p class=\"pp-kicker\">3D 音樂課</p><h1>Pitter<br>Patter</h1><p class=\"pp-lead\">聽見雨點，唱出雨景</p></div></section>",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "g3d-revision",
      "title": "《採桑曲》",
      "notes": "0–4分鐘。播放已學版本，觀察起唱、節奏及旋律熟悉程度。提供 cai-sang-qu.mp3 後由既有媒體控制器播放。",
      "html": "<section id=\"g3d-revision\" class=\"pp-slide sunshine\" data-slide-id=\"g3d-revision\" aria-label=\"《採桑曲》\"><div class=\"pp-copy\"><p class=\"pp-kicker\">熟悉的歌</p><h2>《採桑曲》</h2><p class=\"pp-lead\">我們一起唱！</p><audio id=\"revision-audio\" data-media-id=\"revision-audio\" controls preload=\"none\" src=\"./assets/media/cai-sang-qu.mp3\"></audio></div><div class=\"pp-music-glyph\" aria-hidden=\"true\">♫</div></section>",
      "media": [
        {
          "kind": "audio",
          "src": "./assets/media/cai-sang-qu.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "g3d-rain-scene",
      "title": "花園雨景",
      "notes": "4–6分鐘。先觀察動畫，問雨怎樣移動。雨景的方向是歌詞意象，不能直接當作旋律證據。CSS動畫無聲。",
      "html": "<section id=\"g3d-rain-scene\" class=\"pp-slide scene\" data-slide-id=\"g3d-rain-scene\" aria-label=\"花園雨景\"><img class=\"background-art\" src=\"./assets/images/garden-rain.png\" alt=\"雨點落在繽紛花園中\" loading=\"eager\"><div class=\"pp-rain\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span style=\"--x:8%;--delay:0.0s\">💧</span><span style=\"--x:15%;--delay:-0.5s\">💧</span><span style=\"--x:22%;--delay:-1.0s\">💧</span><span style=\"--x:29%;--delay:-1.5s\">💧</span><span style=\"--x:36%;--delay:-2.0s\">💧</span><span style=\"--x:43%;--delay:0.0s\">💧</span><span style=\"--x:50%;--delay:-0.5s\">💧</span><span style=\"--x:57%;--delay:-1.0s\">💧</span><span style=\"--x:64%;--delay:-1.5s\">💧</span><span style=\"--x:71%;--delay:-2.0s\">💧</span><span style=\"--x:78%;--delay:0.0s\">💧</span><span style=\"--x:85%;--delay:-0.5s\">💧</span></div></section>",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "g3d-poem",
      "title": "Pitter Patter 詩歌",
      "notes": "6–9分鐘。教師讀，學生跟讀。pane指窗玻璃。先讓學生理解文字。歌詞依課本14–15頁。",
      "html": "<section id=\"g3d-poem\" class=\"pp-slide poem\" data-slide-id=\"g3d-poem\" aria-label=\"Pitter Patter 詩歌\"><img class=\"background-art\" src=\"./assets/images/window-rain.png\" alt=\"雨水沿窗玻璃往下流\" loading=\"eager\"><div class=\"pp-copy\"><h2>Pitter Patter</h2><div class=\"pp-lyrics\"><p>Pitter patter pit pat,</p><p>Listen to the rain.</p><p>Falling in the garden,</p><p>Running down the pane.</p></div></div></section>",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "g3d-rain-word-question",
      "title": "這像甚麼聲音？",
      "notes": "先收集學生對pitter patter的理解，再切下一頁揭示。",
      "html": "<section id=\"g3d-rain-word-question\" class=\"pp-slide word-scene\" data-slide-id=\"g3d-rain-word-question\" aria-label=\"這像甚麼聲音？\"><img class=\"background-art\" src=\"./assets/images/garden-rain.png\" alt=\"雨點落在繽紛花園中\" loading=\"eager\"><div class=\"pp-copy\"><h2>這像甚麼聲音？</h2><p class=\"pp-english pp-callout\">Pitter patter<br>pit pat</p></div></section>",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "g3d-rain-word-answer",
      "title": "雨點的聲音",
      "notes": "說明詞語模仿雨聲。下一步以身體聲響嘗試。",
      "html": "<section id=\"g3d-rain-word-answer\" class=\"pp-slide word-scene\" data-slide-id=\"g3d-rain-word-answer\" aria-label=\"雨點的聲音\"><img class=\"background-art\" src=\"./assets/images/window-rain.png\" alt=\"雨水沿窗玻璃往下流\" loading=\"eager\"><div class=\"pp-copy\"><h2>雨點的聲音</h2><p class=\"pp-english pp-callout\">Pitter patter<br>pit pat</p><p class=\"pp-lead\">輕快、連續的雨點聲</p></div></section>",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "g3d-body-percussion",
      "title": "我們的雨點聲",
      "notes": "9–14分鐘。學生探索指尖拍掌、輕拍腿及其他聲音，選一種適合雨景的聲響並解釋原因。插圖提供可能方式，不要求每人使用同一聲音。",
      "html": "<section id=\"g3d-body-percussion\" class=\"pp-slide picture-bottom\" data-slide-id=\"g3d-body-percussion\" aria-label=\"我們的雨點聲\"><div class=\"pp-copy\"><h2>我們的雨點聲</h2><p class=\"pp-lead\">哪種聲音最像雨點？</p></div><img class=\"wide-art\" src=\"./assets/images/body-percussion.png\" alt=\"三位學生輕拍手掌、拍腿和拍手\" loading=\"eager\"></section>",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "g3d-clap-poem",
      "title": "拍一拍，讀一讀",
      "notes": "14–18分鐘。全班拍讀歌詞節奏，教師指著文字帶領，不要求一直拍等長拍子。",
      "html": "<section id=\"g3d-clap-poem\" class=\"pp-slide poem clap-scene\" data-slide-id=\"g3d-clap-poem\" aria-label=\"拍一拍，讀一讀\"><img class=\"background-art\" src=\"./assets/images/body-percussion.png\" alt=\"學生一起拍手，創造雨點聲\" loading=\"eager\"><div class=\"pp-copy\"><h2>拍一拍，讀一讀</h2><div class=\"pp-lyrics\"><p>Pitter patter pit pat,</p><p>Listen to the rain.</p><p>Falling in the garden,</p><p>Running down the pane.</p></div></div></section>",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "g3d-falling-garden",
      "title": "Falling in the garden",
      "notes": "學生雙手往下、原位微屈膝，或坐著做手勢。避免全班突然跪下。這裡動作表現歌詞雨景，旋律下行之後由錄音確認。",
      "html": "<section id=\"g3d-falling-garden\" class=\"pp-slide word-scene\" data-slide-id=\"g3d-falling-garden\" aria-label=\"Falling in the garden\"><img class=\"background-art\" src=\"./assets/images/garden-rain.png\" alt=\"雨點落在繽紛花園中\" loading=\"eager\"><div class=\"pp-copy\"><h2 class=\"pp-english\">Falling in<br>the garden</h2><p class=\"pp-lead\">雨點落在花園裡</p></div></section>",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "g3d-running-pane",
      "title": "Running down the pane",
      "notes": "指出pane意思，可用手勢模仿雨水沿窗滑下。",
      "html": "<section id=\"g3d-running-pane\" class=\"pp-slide word-scene\" data-slide-id=\"g3d-running-pane\" aria-label=\"Running down the pane\"><img class=\"background-art\" src=\"./assets/images/window-rain.png\" alt=\"雨水沿窗玻璃往下流\" loading=\"eager\"><div class=\"pp-copy\"><h2 class=\"pp-english\">Running down<br>the pane</h2><p class=\"pp-lead\">雨水沿窗玻璃滑下</p></div></section>",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "g3d-melody-question",
      "title": "旋律怎樣走？",
      "notes": "18–22分鐘。這頁不播放音訊。指着課本歌曲樂譜，引導學生沿四句音符觀察高低位置，以手勢追蹤並說明判斷。先判斷再切答案頁；留意同音和局部上行，不能說每個音都下降。後面的學唱頁再用錄音示範。 樂譜按IMG_5559.pdf第15頁重繪為可編輯SVG，保留D大調、2/4拍、八小節及原旋律節奏。這是歌曲旋律譜；沒有另加鋼琴伴奏聲部。",
