    {
      "id": "g3d-melody-and-rain",
      "title": "下行旋律與雨景",
      "notes": "22–25分鐘。要求學生引用所聽樂句連結雨落下、沿窗滑下，必要時重播。以說話與手勢作assessment。",
      "html": "<section id=\"g3d-melody-and-rain\" class=\"pp-slide word-scene\" data-slide-id=\"g3d-melody-and-rain\" aria-label=\"下行旋律與雨景\"><img class=\"background-art\" src=\"./assets/images/window-rain.png\" alt=\"雨水沿窗玻璃往下流\" loading=\"eager\"><div class=\"pp-copy\"><h2>下行旋律<br>怎樣配合雨景？</h2><p class=\"pp-english\">Falling…<br>Running down…</p></div></section>",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "g3d-sing-together",
      "title": "一起唱！",
      "notes": "25–35分鐘。使用這頁錄音完成學唱：先聽全曲，再播放一句、暫停、學生模仿；難句重播，四句學後連接，最後整合歌唱、雨點聲響與向下動作。錄音代替教師唱示範。身體聲響不要蓋過歌聲。既有iPad控制器可播放及暫停；没有虛構分句秒數。",
      "html": "<section id=\"g3d-sing-together\" class=\"pp-slide poem\" data-slide-id=\"g3d-sing-together\" aria-label=\"一起唱！\"><img class=\"background-art\" src=\"./assets/images/garden-rain.png\" alt=\"雨點落在繽紛花園中\" loading=\"eager\"><div class=\"pp-copy\"><h2>一起唱！</h2><div class=\"pp-lyrics\"><p>Pitter patter pit pat,</p><p>Listen to the rain.</p><p>Falling in the garden,</p><p>Running down the pane.</p></div><audio id=\"sing-audio\" data-media-id=\"sing-audio\" controls preload=\"none\" src=\"./assets/media/pitter-patter.mp3\"></audio></div></section>",
      "media": [
        {
          "kind": "audio",
          "src": "./assets/media/pitter-patter.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "g3d-recap",
      "title": "今天的雨景與旋律",
      "notes": "歌曲部分最後檢查：旋律主要下行配合雨落下、沿窗滑下。學生以手勢和口頭解釋。",
      "html": "<section id=\"g3d-recap\" class=\"pp-slide sky\" data-slide-id=\"g3d-recap\" aria-label=\"今天的雨景與旋律\"><div class=\"pp-copy\"><h2>今天的雨景與旋律</h2><p class=\"pp-lead\">下行旋律怎樣配合雨景？</p><p class=\"pp-lead\">用手勢和說話告訴大家。</p></div></section>",
      "media": []
    }
